title: The Reformists
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: never
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; reformist_timer += 6
card-image: img/portraits/BraunOtto.jpg

= The Reformists

The Reformist faction holds many of our most notable members. How shall we make use of their talents?

-	@use_ebert: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Friedrich Ebert
- @use_scheidemann: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Phillip Scheidemann
-	@use_severing: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Carl Severing
-	@use_braun: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Otto Braun
-	@use_juchacz: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Marie Juchacz
-	@use_pfulf: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Antonie Pfülf
-	@use_baade: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Fritz Baade
-	@use_hirschfeld: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Magnus Hirschfeld
-	@use_radbruch: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Gustav Radbruch
-	@use_stampfer: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Friedrich Stampfer
- @use_lobe: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Paul Löbe
-	@use_mierendorff: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Carlo Mierendorff
-	@use_schumacher: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Kurt Schumacher
-	@use_leber: We will use the talents of the Reformist leader, Julius Leber
- @boost_reformists_influence_subtle: We will subtly promote the Reformists faction as not to anger any of the other factions.
- @boost_reformists_influence_blatant: We will openly promote the Reformist faction.
- @hindenburg: We will use the Reformists’ connections to attempt to come to an understanding with President Hindenburg.
- @grand_coalition_relations: We will use the Reformists’ connections to attempt to come to an understanding with the bourgeois parties.
- @reduce_reformists_dissent: We will work to reduce dissent within the faction.
- @new_reformist_leader: [+ reformist_leader +] has served well, but new leadership is required.
- @root: We will do none of these things.
- @easy_discard: We will consider this at a later time.

@use_ebert
view-if: reformist_leader == "Ebert"
go-to: ebert

@use_scheidemann
view-if: reformist_leader == "Scheidemann"
go-to: scheidemann

@use_severing
view-if: reformist_leader == "Severing"
go-to: severing

@use_braun
view-if: reformist_leader == "Braun"
go-to: braun

@use_juchacz
view-if: reformist_leader == "Juchacz"
go-to: juchacz

@use_pfulf
view-if: reformist_leader == "Pfülf"
go-to: pfulf

@use_mierendorff
view-if: reformist_leader == "Mierendorff"
go-to: mierendorff

@use_schumacher
view-if: reformist_leader == "Schumacher"
go-to: schumacher

@use_leber
view-if: reformist_leader == "Leber"
go-to: leber

@use_baade
view-if: reformist_leader == "Baade"
go-to: baade

@use_hirschfeld
view-if: reformist_leader == "Hirschfeld"
go-to: hirschfeld

@use_radbruch
view-if: reformist_leader == "Rabdruch"
go-to: radbruch

@use_stampfer
view-if: reformist_leader == "Stampfer"
go-to: stampfer

@use_lobe
view-if: reformist_leader == "Löbe"
go-to: lobe

@boost_reformists_influence_subtle
on-arrival: reformists_strength += 5; reformists_dissent -= 3

We have made subtle moves to boost the popularity of the Reformist faction.

@boost_reformists_influence_blatant
on-arrival: reformists_strength += 10; reformists_dissent -= 5; center_dissent += 3; labor_dissent += 3; left_dissent += 3

We have openly promoted the Reformist faction, to the anger of the other factions.

@hindenburg
view-if: president == "Hindenburg"
on-arrival: presidential_relation += 3*(1-dissent)

We have used our Reformist’s connections, particularly through Otto Braun, to meet with President Hindenburg. Our meetings with are frosty to say the least, but they are meetings nonetheless.

@grand_coalition_relations
on-arrival: z_relation += 3; ddp_relation += 3 ; dvp_relation += 3 ; presidential_relation += 3

We have used the Reformists’ connections to try to come to an understanding with the Bourgeois parties.

@reduce_reformists_dissent
on-arrival: reformists_dissent -= 10

We have worked to reduce dissent within the Reformist faction.

@new_reformist_leader

We must now select a new leader for the Reformist Faction.

- @reformist_leader_juchacz
- @reformist_leader_severing
- @reformist_leader_braun
- @reformist_leader_pfulf
- @reformist_leader_baade
- @reformist_leader_hirschfeld
- @reformist_leader_radbruch
- @reformist_leader_stampfer
- @reformist_leader_lobe
- @reformist_leader_mierendorff
- @reformist_leader_schumacher
- @reformist_leader_leber
- @root: We have changed our minds.
- @easy_discard: We will consider this at a later time.

@reformist_leader_severing
title: Carl Severing
subtitle: Carl Severing is a one-time Prussian interior minister and police reformer.
view-if: reformist_leader != "Severing" and spd_coleader_1 != "Severing" and spd_coleader_2 != "Severing" and spd_coleader_3 != "Severing"
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/SeveringCarl.jpg
on-arrival: reformist_leader = "Severing"; reformist_leader_fullname = "Carl Severing"
go-to: death_of_levi if succession_levi == 1; death_of_muller if succession_muller == 1

Carl Severing has been agreed as faction leader.

